# Everything the plugin ships, and nothing else: tools/release_tree.py copies exactly these files into the tree that
# the `release` branch holds, and fails if a module the plugin loads imports something that is not listed.
# One path per line, relative to the repository root. A line with two paths copies the first to the second.
# A new runtime file belongs here; `uv run tools/release_tree.py check` fails until it is.
.claude-plugin/plugin.json
# The tree is also a marketplace of its own, so a team can pin a released version by tag (see CONTRIBUTING.md).
